Link minds with the target.  While your minds are linked, you'll inflict [16%, 22%, 27%, 30%, 34% (TL1-5; MP 100)] more mind damage to the target and gain telepathy for its creature type.

Only one mindlink can be maintained at a time, and the effect will break if the target dies or goes beyond range (14)).

The mind damage bonus will scale with your Mindpower.
